{
  "id": "E316",
  "title": "Picnic in the Botanical Garden",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-04-21",
  "synopsis": "What would you do on a sunny weekend?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1023/fe7a6a13f21d369aa6b70fb7fc1a428299ff8663.mp3?1554469546",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "去植物园野餐吧\n\n小乐：天气预报说这个周末天气很好。快想想我们去哪里玩吧！\n保罗：动物园怎么样？我们很久没去看动物了。\n小乐：动物园是不错，但是可能会有很多爸爸妈妈带着小朋友。会不会有点吵？\n保罗：那我们去植物园？应该会安静一些。\n小乐：好主意！我们再带一些吃的，一起去野餐吧。",
    "traditional": "去植物園野餐吧\n\n小樂：天氣預報說這個週末天氣很好。快想想我們去哪裏玩吧！\n保羅：動物園怎麼樣？我們很久沒去看動物了。\n小樂：動物園是不錯，但是可能會有很多爸爸媽媽帶著小朋友。會不會有點吵？\n保羅：那我們去植物園？應該會安靜一些。\n小樂：好主意！我們再帶一些吃的，一起去野餐吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Let’s have a picnic in the botanical garden"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：天气预报说这个周末天气很好。快想想我们去哪里玩吧！",
      "traditional": "小樂：天氣預報說這個週末天氣很好。快想想我們去哪裏玩吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè tiān qì yù bào shuō zhè ge zhōu mò tiān qì hěn hǎo kuài xiǎng xiǎng wǒ men qù nǎ lǐ wán ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: The weather report says the weather will be good this weekend. Quick, think of a fun place to go!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：动物园怎么样？我们很久没去看动物了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：動物園怎麼樣？我們很久沒去看動物了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó dòng wù yuán zěn me yàng wǒ men hěn jiǔ méi qù kàn dòng wù le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: How about the zoo? We haven’t gone to see the animals in a long time."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：动物园是不错，但是可能会有很多爸爸妈妈带着小朋友。",
      "traditional": "小樂：動物園是不錯，但是可能會有很多爸爸媽媽帶著小朋友。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè dòng wù yuán shì bú cuò dàn shì kě néng huì yǒu hěn duō bà ba mā ma dài zhe xiǎo péng you",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "会不会有点吵？",
      "traditional": "會不會有點吵？",
      "pinyin": "huì bú huì yǒu diǎn chǎo",
      "english": "Little Le: The zoo sounds good, but there might be many moms and dads with their kids."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Maybe it will be a bit noisy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "保罗：那我们去植物园？应该会安静一些。",
      "traditional": "保羅：那我們去植物園？應該會安靜一些。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nà wǒ men qù zhí wù yuán yīng gāi huì ān jìng yì xiē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Then, how about going to the botanical garden? It should be a bit quieter."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小乐：好主意！我们再带一些吃的，一起去野餐吧。",
      "traditional": "小樂：好主意！我們再帶一些吃的，一起去野餐吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hǎo zhǔ yi wǒ men zài dài yì xiē chī de yì qǐ qù yě cān ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Good idea! Let’s also bring something to eat and have a picnic there."
    }
  ],
